# Root ignore rules.
#
# This file is currently owned by the data-discovery work. Rules below cover the
# local data root and credentials. Application/build rules are added by the
# milestone that creates the application, in a separate section.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local data root
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw source downloads, intermediate processing outputs, and derived datasets
# are never committed. See data/README.md for what belongs in each directory.
# The ignore is deliberately broad — everything under data/ is ignored except
# the documentation and provenance files explicitly re-included below.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/README.md
!data/**/.gitkeep

# Belt-and-braces: geospatial and tabular payloads are never committed from
# anywhere in the tree, whatever directory they end up in.
*.nc
*.nc4
*.hdf
*.hdf5
*.h5
*.tif
*.tiff
*.img
*.grd
*.bil
*.bsq
*.asc
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.sbn
*.sbx
*.prj
*.cpg
*.qix
*.gdb/
*.gpkg
*.gpkg-shm
*.gpkg-wal
*.mpk
*.lpk
*.lpkx
*.tpk
*.tpkx
*.parquet
*.feather
*.zip
*.gz
*.tar
*.tgz
*.7z
*.laz
*.las

# CSV is ignored by default because AIS extracts arrive as CSV. Small committed
# reference tables must be re-included explicitly, one path at a time.
*.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials and local configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
credentials.json
token.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor, OS, and tooling noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
